From: woahwhattheheck <293286387+woahwhattheheck@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 03:10:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: allow to configure social links

Add a `socialLinks` mount option that renders GitHub, Twitter, donate
and custom links in a fixed section at the bottom of the sidebar, with
Feather icons. Accepts an object ({ github, twitter, donate, custom })
or an ordered array of links; GitHub/Twitter accept a `user/repo` or
username shorthand. The board list now scrolls above the fixed section.

Closes #19
