 Then `title` defaults to `Demoboard`.
 
+### Customize Social Links
+
+Show links to your GitHub repository, Twitter profile, donation page, etc. in a fixed section at the bottom of the sidebar:
+
+```js
+import { create, mount } from 'demoboard'
+
+const demoboard = create()
+
+mount(demoboard, '#app', {
+  socialLinks: {
+    // A full URL or a `user/repo` shorthand for https://github.com/user/repo
+    github: 'egoist/demoboard',
+    // A full URL or a username shorthand for https://twitter.com/username
+    twitter: '_egoistlily',
+    donate: 'https://patreon.com/egoist',
+    custom: [
+      // Shown as an icon followed by its title
+      { title: 'Website', link: 'https://egoist.sh' },
+      // Shown as an icon-only link, `title` is used as its tooltip
+      {
+        title: 'Discord',
+        link: 'https://chat.egoist.moe',
+        icon: <DiscordIcon />
+      }
+    ]
+  }
+})
+```
+
+Every link is optional. Each built-in link also accepts an object to override its tooltip, e.g. `github: { link: 'egoist/demoboard', title: 'Source code' }`.
+
+To control the order of the links, pass an array instead, where `type` is one of `github`, `twitter`, `donate` or omitted for a custom link:
+
+```js
+mount(demoboard, '#app', {
+  socialLinks: [
+    { type: 'twitter', link: '_egoistlily' },
+    { type: 'github', link: 'egoist/demoboard' },
+    { title: 'Website', link: 'https://egoist.sh' }
+  ]
+})
+```
+
